{"id":"3c96263d588c39b6","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-forcing12-quotient-condition.md","title":"ZFC Forcing12 Quotient Condition","display":"df-zfc-forcing12-quotient-condition — ZFC Forcing12 Quotient Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-quotient-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing12-quotient-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing12-quotient-condition — ZFC Forcing12 Quotient Condition","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-filter]]","[[58-df-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-quotient-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing12-quotient-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing12-quotient-condition — ZFC Forcing12 Quotient Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q,G,p,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\\in V\">\\(P,Q,G,p,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq P\">\\(Q\\subseteq P\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq Q\">\\(G\\subseteq Q\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P^2\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P^2\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_Q\\subseteq Q^2\">\\(\\leq_Q\\subseteq Q^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12QuotientCondition}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12QuotientCondition}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12QuotientCondition}_S(p,P,Q,G,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land Q\\subseteq P\\land\\leq_Q=\\leq_P\\cap(Q\\times Q)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,Q,\\leq_Q)\\land p\\in P\\land\\forall q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\leq_P p\\land r\\leq_P q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12QuotientCondition}_S(p,P,Q,G,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land Q\\subseteq P\\land\\leq_Q=\\leq_P\\cap(Q\\times Q)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,Q,\\leq_Q)\\land p\\in P\\land\\forall q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\leq_P p\\land r\\leq_P q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the condition-level compatibility predicate relative to explicit ambient and suborder relations; genericity and completeness of the suborder are separate hypotheses in a full quotient-forcing construction.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-poset]]) and $\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-filter]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-poset]]) and $\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-filter]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,Q,G,p,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"G\\subseteq Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_Q\\subseteq Q^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12QuotientCondition}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12QuotientCondition}_S(p,P,Q,G,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land Q\\subseteq P\\land\\leq_Q=\\leq_P\\cap(Q\\times Q)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,Q,\\leq_Q)\\land p\\in P\\land\\forall q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\leq_P p\\land r\\leq_P q)","display":true}],"bytes":1316,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2054","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-forcing12-quotient-condition.md|58-df-zfc-forcing12-quotient-condition]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","1331244a5201bb99","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}